💥 As a result of strikes by high-precision air-based weapons and unmanned aerial vehicles, the following targets were hit:

▫️ a fuel tank for the AFU – at Port of Odessa;

▫️ two dry cargo ships delivered military cargo – at Yuzhny Port;

▫️ a dry cargo ship, delivering cargo to the AFU at Port of Odessa, during crossing the sea (northwest of the Zmeiny Island)

